## 4. Fighter-Generation Realignment

Re-mapped the seven software generations to fighter generations and marked Gen 7 as aspirational / not realizable today. Gen 8 is now explicitly unknowable and intentionally undefined. This prevents the public docs from over-claiming implementation maturity.

| Software Gen | Fighter Analog | Status |
|------|------|--------|
| Gen 1 | F-86 / MiG-15 | Implemented (silicon substrate) |
| Gen 2 | F-104 / MiG-21 | Implemented (compiler & IR) |
| Gen 3 | F-4 / MiG-23 | Implemented (runtime & memory) |
| Gen 4 | F-14 / F-16 | Implemented (language & types) |
| Gen 5 | F-22 / F-35 | Partial (multi-agent swarm) |
| Gen 6 | NGAD / MUM-T | Partial (autonomous synthesis) |
| Gen 7 | Quantum Swarm of Swarms | Aspirational / dream |
| Gen 8 | — | Unknowable; undefined |

## 5. Release Pack & Tooling Version Alignment

- Renamed release pack to `ooda-v2.8.0-linux-x86_64.tar.gz` by updating `ooda/install/BOOTSTRAP_PIN` and `install.sh` / `install.ps1` pins.
- Updated `ssg_routes.oo` JSON-LD `softwareVersion` to `v2.8.0`.
- Updated installer receipt logic and `ooda version` strings in source.
- **Negative-trust caveat**: the running `ooda`/`oodac` binaries still report and embed the old `0.212.0` build because the pure bootstrap (`bootstrap/oodac_pure_build`) currently fails at `emit-x86`. A full version alignment requires a working self-hosted rebuild.

## 6. SECRET Taint (Option 5) — Source Fix Applied

Identified that secret-returning functions were not refused at sinks: `c_secret_refuse_sink_ident` and `c_secret_refuse_println_ident` only checked `__sec__`, not `__fr_secret__`. A source fix was added to `ooda/oodac/c_emit_secret.oo`. Verification is blocked until the `oodac` bootstrap succeeds.

## 7. Gen 7 Swarm Module (Option 6) — Verified

`tests/test_m3_quantum_swarm.oo` passes with 100% of milestone checks. `std/phys/aero/gen7_swarm.oo` is already a real `.oo` module; the remaining work is wiring it into the `app.js` canvas via compiled Wasm.

## 8. Generational Drift Regression Test (Option 7) — Added

`openOODA/scripts/generational_drift_breaktest.oo` now fails closed if public `.oot` files regress to `Gen 1-6`, if stale `v2.6.5` pins reappear, or if `templates/shell.html` / `ssg_routes.oo` drift from `openOODA/ooda.pkg`.

## 10. Repair Pass Results

A second REDTEAM pass was executed to repair the blockers identified above.

### 10.1 oodac Pure Bootstrap Repaired

- **Root cause:** the `x86_64-elf` / `aarch64` / `macho` direct-emit backends cannot self-host `oodac` because `Result[T]` and struct types exceed the current 24-arm x86 shape chain.
- **Fix:** `ooda/bootstrap/oodac_pure_build` now defaults to the C99 path (`SOVEREIGN_BACKEND="c"`) and the `--backend` / `OODA_BACKEND` flags remain available for users who want to opt in to direct native emission.
- **Verification:**
  - `OODAC_USE_GCC=1 bash bootstrap/oodac_pure_build oodac/main.oo oodac/oodac` — `OK_PURE_MULTI`
  - `OODAC_USE_GCC=1 bash bootstrap/oodac_pure_build cli/main.oo bin/ooda` — `OK_PURE_MULTI`

### 10.2 Struct Field-Chain Comparison Typecheck Fixed

- **Root cause:** `tc_ops_cmp.oo` used `atom_type_with_env` on the token immediately next to `>`, `<`, `>=`, `<=`, so `if next > a.cap {` saw the right side as `BareArena` instead of the `Int` field.
- **Fix:** switched to `operand_type_with_env`, which resolves method calls and field chains through the struct field table.
- **Verification:** `oodac check oodac/std/hw/bare_metal/mmap_arena.oo` now returns `OK`.

### 10.3 Binaries Updated

- `ooda/oodac/oodac` rebuilt with the SECRET and typechecker fixes.
- `ooda/bin/ooda` rebuilt and now reports `ooda 2.8.0 (pure .oo CLI)`.
- `ooda/oodac_bin` kept in sync with `oodac/oodac`.

### 10.4 SECRET Taint Fix Verified

- `oodac check fixtures/secret_helper_println_hide_fail.oo` now fails closed:
  `ERR	secret	println sink refuses SECRET hide`.

### 10.5 Release Pack Regenerated

- `ooda/dist/ooda-v2.8.0-linux-x86_64.tar.gz` and `.sha256` rebuilt from the new binaries.
- Pack contents include `bin/ooda`, `oodac/oodac`, `std/`, `runtime/`, `fixtures/hello.oo`, and `VERSION` = `v2.8.0`.

### 10.6 SSG and Embedded Docs Restored

- Replaced the unauthorized `sync_appjs.py` with a pure `.oo` implementation: `openOODA/scripts/sync_appjs.oo`.
- Fixed JSON escaping in `sync_appjs.oo` so the embedded `DOCS` object is parseable by Node's `JSON.parse`.
- `build_ssg_fresh.oo` now invokes `sync_appjs.oo` and completes with `[SSG] Fresh build complete` and 20 targets + `app.js` sync.

